      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes three individuals with the text 'when nobody knew who you were' and 'until you got on your knees.' The visual and textual elements together imply that the individuals' public recognition or status was achieved only after they performed a submissive or humiliating act. This can be interpreted as mocking or belittling the individuals, suggesting their value or fame is contingent on submission. The meme may be perceived as demeaning and potentially harmful due to its implication of worth being tied to submission, which can be seen as degrading. The overall intent is to ridicule or diminish the perceived value of the individuals based on their actions, which may be interpreted as harmful to their dignity or public image.",
